In the conversation, James Rising received an email from Christian Agu, a prospective PhD student, seeking supervision for his proposal on "Climate change as a driver of international migration in developing countries." Agu introduced his academic background and provided attachments of his proposal and CV. James asked for assistance in drafting a professional email response. He stated that he is not taking new students this year but offered to suggest other faculty or provide guidance. The final response included a suggestion for a brief chat and a link to schedule it, maintaining a supportive and professional tone throughout.
